---
// Footer: FCS Attribution, FCS Badge, sitemap links, and legal entity standards
---

<footer class="footer-wrapper">
  <div class="container footer-container">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <div class="brand-box">
          <div class="footer-logo-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2a8 8 0 0 0-8 8c0 5.25 8 12 8 12s8-6.75 8-12a8 8 0 0 0-8-8z"></path>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="footer-brand-name">FamLoop</span>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-tagline">
          Platform pelacakan lokasi keluarga real-time yang aman, hemat baterai, dan tahan firewall. Ketenangan pikiran untuk orang tua dan anak di Indonesia.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-nav-group">
        <h4>Navigasi</h4>
        <a href="#demo">Simulasi Peta</a>
        <a href="#keunggulan">Keunggulan</a>
        <a href="#cara-kerja">Cara Kerja</a>
        <a href="#privasi">Privasi & Keamanan</a>
        <a href="#faq">Tanya Jawab</a>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-nav-group">
        <h4>Informasi & SEO</h4>
        <a href="/sitemap.xml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sitemap XML</a>
        <a href="/llms.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Konteks AI (llms.txt)</a>
        <a href="/robots.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Robots.txt</a>
        <a href="https://fujiwaracreative.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PT FUJIWARA CREATIVE SOLUSINDO</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FCS Badge & Attribution Section (Pilar 2 fcs-seo-geo) -->
    <div class="footer-fcs-attribution">
      <div class="fcs-badge-wrapper">
        <script 
          src="https://fujiwaracreative.my.id/assets/js/fcs-badge.js" 
          data-project="famloop" 
          data-theme="dark" 
          defer>
        </script>
      </div>
      <p class="fcs-text">
        Dirancang dan dikembangkan dengan dedikasi oleh 
        <a href="https://fujiwaracreative.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="fcs-link">
          PT FUJIWARA CREATIVE SOLUSINDO
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© 2026 FamLoop. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi.</p>
      <p class="footer-subtext">Aplikasi pemantauan keluarga mandiri. Tidak berafiliasi dengan jaringan periklanan pihak ketiga.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-wrapper {
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .footer-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .brand-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .footer-logo-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .footer-brand-name {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .footer-tagline {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  .footer-nav-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-nav-group h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .footer-nav-group a {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .footer-nav-group a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .footer-fcs-attribution {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 2.25rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .fcs-text {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .fcs-link {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
